<h3><u>Yaad aayi na tumhe fatema sughra</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Baba ka karte karte intezarr...<br />
Jab thak gyi sughra...<br />
Ro ro k apne baba ko...<br />
Sughra ne khat likha...<br />
Tum gye ghr se meri luth gyi duniya baba..<br />
Yaad ayi na tumhe fatima sughra baba..&times;2<br />
Karbala jake hamein bhool gye kia baba..<br />
Yaad ayi na...&times;2</p>

<p>1. Kya kahun usne hai kis tarha se tadpaya mjhe..<br />
Eid ka chand falak par jo nazar aaya mujhe..<br />
Us ghadi dil may mere..&times;2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp; Dard utha tha baba...<br />
Yaad ayi na tumhein..&times;2</p>

<p>2. Baba thi neend guzari hai yahan ro ro kar..<br />
Mjhko eidi may mile askh jafa zakhme jigar..<br />
Mainey har eid pe ye..&times;2...Nauha padha tha baba<br />
Yaad ayi na..&times;2</p>

<p>3. Ab to asghar bhi mera ghutniyon chalta hoga.<br />
Yaad kar kar mjhe jhoole may machalta hoga..<br />
Mujhko sab yaad hai par..&times;2 zulm hai kaisa baba...<br />
Yaad ayi na tumhe...&times;2</p>

<p>4. Sunti hu dasht may akbar ki rachayi shaadi...<br />
Bhai qasim k bhi haato may lagi hai mehndi...<br />
Jab sakina ko wahan..&times;2<br />
Negh diya tha baba...<br />
Yaad aayi na tumhe...&times;2</p>

<p>5. Baba qismat se muqaddar se gila kya karna..<br />
Mere akbar ne bhula daala jo wada apna...<br />
Khat mera dasht may jab..&times;2<br />
Aapne paya baba...</p>

<p>6. Jab nazar aate hain bacchon k ye khali hujre...<br />
Yaad phir auno-mohd ki satati hai mjhe...<br />
Sab ki yaadon ne mjhe..&times;2<br />
Khoon rulaya baba...</p>

<p>7. Kaise farhan ye mazhar ye masaib likhe...<br />
Fatima sughra k ehsas qalam band kiye...<br />
Kaun abh aake mjhe...&times;2<br />
Dega dilasa baba...<br />
Yaad ayi na tumhe fatima sughra baba....</p>
</p>
